<title>NEW ZEALAND: United to win Ohariu-Belmont - TVNZ projection.</title>
<headline>United to win Ohariu-Belmont - TVNZ projection.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Television New Zealand is projecting United's Peter Dunne to win the Ohariu-Belmont electorate seat after 2.7 percent of the vote in that seat counted at 9.15 p.m. (0815 GMT).</p>
<p>After 2.7 percent vote:</p>
<p>					    Number of Votes</p>
<p>    Peter Dunne	   (United)	    238</p>
<p>    Verna Smith	   (Labour)	    101</p>
<p>    Phillida Bunkle     (Alliance)	   71</p>
<p>    Ken Shirley	   (Act NZ)	     47</p>
<p>    Erine Davis	   (NZ First)	   35</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
